{"id":"NCT04179929","title":"Treatment of Breakpoint Cluster Region-Abelson (BCR-ABL) Negative ALL in Adults","official":"Treatment of BCR-ABL Negative ALL in Adults According to MRD and Genetics","summary":"After consolidation therapy adult patients (≥18 yr) with Ph-negative ALL will be treated with continuation chemotherapy or allogeneic hematopoietic stem cell transplantation (alloHSCT) according to both measurable residual disease (MRD) and results of genetic study performed at baseline.","conditions":["Acute Lymphoblastic Leukemia"],"interventions":[{"type":"DRUG","name":"Pediatric-type of chemotherapy"},{"type":"PROCEDURE","name":"allogeneic HSCT"}],"criteria":"Inclusion Criteria:\n\n* Patients 18-60 yr with de novo Ph-neg ALL\n* Eastern Cooperative Oncology Group (ECOG) 0-2 (or \\>2 if due to ALL)\n* Informed consent\n\nExclusion Criteria:\n\n* Mature B-ALL, Ph+ ALL or blast crisis of chronic myeloid leukemia (CML), ALL of ambiguous lineage\n* ECOG \\>2 not due to ALL\n* Impaired cardiac, respiratory, hepatic or renal function not due to ALL\n* Pregnancy\n* HIV positivity\n* Severe psychiatric disease\n* Negative to sign informed consent.","minAge":"18 Years","maxAge":"60 Years","sex":"ALL","healthy":false,"studyType":"INTERVENTIONAL","purpose":"TREATMENT","enrollment":300,"start":"2019-11-25","pcd":"2026-11","upd":"2022-02-18","sponsor":"PETHEMA Foundation","areas":["oncology","rare"],"central":["Josep Maria Ribera, Ph · 934978987 · jribera@iconcologia.net"],"sites":[{"f":"Ico-Hugtip","city":"Badalona","pr":"","zip":"08916","s":"R","lat":41.45,"lon":2.2474,"c":"Jose Maria Ribera Santasusana · 934978987 · jribera@iconcologia.net"},{"f":"H. A Coruña","city":"A Coruña","pr":"","zip":"","s":"NYR","lat":43.3713,"lon":-8.396,"c":"Víctor Noriega Concepción"},{"f":"H Albacete","city":"Albacete","pr":"","zip":"","s":"NYR","lat":38.9942,"lon":-1.8564,"c":"José Santiago Bermón"},{"f":"H. General Univ. de Alicante","city":"Alicante","pr":"","zip":"","s":"R","lat":38.345